1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,095
The test the group could not control arrived as a single sheet of paper.

2
00:00:04,095 --> 00:00:12,356
A regional reading survey would include their method, and the administration wanted a decision by the end of the quarter.

3
00:00:12,356 --> 00:00:16,915
“None of us can tell how this will end,” Maya said.

4
00:00:16,915 --> 00:00:30,545
“We can only decide what to send.” A grey drawing of the reading tank — their own childish sketch — lay on the table beside the official form, and every line of it looked wrong.

5
00:00:30,545 --> 00:00:37,252
The population of the survey was a million students, and their sample was a few hundred.

6
00:00:37,252 --> 00:00:42,666
“To be frank, that is a lot of noise,” the principal said.

7
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:50,003
“Your best hope is a quite small, clean result.” Each of them knew it already.

8
00:00:50,003 --> 00:00:55,836
Every classification has an edge, and theirs was the edge of the page.

9
00:00:55,836 --> 00:01:00,549
The least they could do was say so in advance.

10
00:01:00,549 --> 00:01:05,682
They decided to send the method itself, not the results.

11
00:01:05,682 --> 00:01:15,983
A vertical line, a signature, a stamp, and a bundle of cord went into one parcel, which looked like a costume rather than a proposal.

12
00:01:15,983 --> 00:01:30,703
“If the survey finds nothing,” Lin wrote, “that is a confirmation, not a disaster.” A spark of doubt remained, but the chorus of agreement was louder than the doubt.

13
00:01:30,703 --> 00:01:33,762
They discussed the wording for an hour.

14
00:01:33,762 --> 00:01:43,588
To throw the old version away was tempting, but a continuation is not a rejection; it is a steel beam added under a wooden floor.

15
00:01:43,588 --> 00:01:47,427
“Browse the appendix,” Maya said.

16
00:01:47,427 --> 00:01:59,818
“A panda, a wolf, and a dragon in a child's drawing taught us more than the survey ever will.” The tap dripped, and nobody moved to close it.

17
00:01:59,818 --> 00:02:11,813
A slip of white paper, a leaf from an organic farm, a pound of spare paper, and a small bottle of liquid were their belongings on the last night of the term.

18
00:02:11,813 --> 00:02:25,468
“You are the hero of your own report,” Professor Zhao said, “and that is exactly the problem.” Several of them sat in silence; some smiled at the other volunteers.

19
00:02:25,468 --> 00:02:30,771
“Granted, you have very little time,” she went on.

20
00:02:30,771 --> 00:02:46,761
“But a thread is enough to hold a signature together, and a crane can lift what a hand cannot.” There was no solution, only a decision: a new line, which many of them preferred to most of the old ones.

21
00:02:46,761 --> 00:02:53,771
Her eye caught the remaining problem in it, but really there was no time.
